{"id":"habit","lemma":"habit","pos":"noun","rank":2410,"glosses":["article of clothing, garment, dress-coat, evening dress, tails, full dress"],"ipa":"/a.bi/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/66/Fr-habit.ogg/Fr-habit.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"habits"},"formAudio":{"habits":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a8/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-habits.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Apporte-moi mes habits.","en":"Bring me my clothes.","words":[{"g":"to bring","l":"apporter"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"L'habit fait l'homme.","en":"Clothes make the man.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"man"}]},{"text":"Tu portes toujours les mêmes habits.","en":"You're always wearing the same clothes.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"door","l":"porte"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"same","l":"même"},null]},{"text":"Ces habits te vont bien.","en":"These clothes suit you.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"well"}]},{"text":"J'aime porter de vieux habits.","en":"I like wearing old clothes.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"to carry"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"old"},null]}]}